/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (The success of the IBM Innovators Club is driven by its dedicated animators, a team of students and mentors who guide participants from idea to prototype \(Yasser Hanafi, Abderahman Seaid, Achraf Essaouli, Taha Bichouina, Rajaa Masry, Hantar Saad\). Throughout the semester, the club organized hands-on workshops covering 3D modeling \(SolidWorks\), 3D printing and rapid prototyping, Arduino and microcontroller basics, sensor integration, electronics and wiring safety, and design thinking for problem-solving, presentation criterias, AI development. During the Innovate3D hackathon, these animators played a key role by mentoring teams, troubleshooting technical issues, and encouraging collaborative innovation, ensuring that every participant gained both technical skills and real engineering experience.)
