/E (Project: Mars ReVive is a sustainable recycling and resource recovery system designed to support long-term human missions on Mars. The project aims to transform mission waste such as metals, plastics, and organic materials into reusable resources for construction, repair, and energy generation. Through autonomous robots and AI-powered sorting, Mars ReVive efficiently manages waste while conserving energy. The system creates a circular process where nothing goes unused, reducing dependence on Earth resupply missions and promoting self-sufficiency. By turning waste into opportunity, Mars ReVive helps build a cleaner, more sustainable Martian habitat and paves the way for future generations of explorers to live and thrive beyond Earth.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
