385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (Sacrifice Doors turns the idea of progress on its head. The game begins as a sleek platforming challenge where players sprint, jump, and parkour their way through layered stages toward a waiting door. But each door demands a price. To advance, the player must permanently sacrifice one ability, slowly stripping away their own power. With every level, movement becomes more fragile, decisions grow heavier, and mastery replaces comfort. By the final stage, players face a relentless boss with barely any abilities left, transforming the fight into a tense test of ingenuity, timing, and resolve. Sacrifice Doors is a sharp, minimalist exploration of loss, forcing players to confront how much they are willing to give up just to move forward.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
