/E (At IBN MANDOUR High School, the Speak Up Club, founded by Ahlam Khalid and Aya, provides students with a fun and supportive space to practice English. Open to anyone with an A2 level or higher, the club organizes debates, public speaking sessions, and interactive games, with plans for dramas and competitions in the future. Unlike regular classes, it focuses on speaking and producing content rather than just reading. Through these activities, students build confidence, overcome shyness, and improve their communication skills effectively.)
